# Claude Code. Skills and commands arrive via the memtoad plugin, not by being copied
# into the repo, so nothing here should be tracked by default. The one exception is
# import-model, which is this project's own skill.
.claude/commands/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/import-model/

